            <ArticleTitle>Successful coronary stenting in a 4-year-old child.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>202-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This report describes a 4-yr-old with critical coronary artery stenosis acquired after surgery for congenital heart disease. The patient was treated successfully with coronary stenting after unsuccessful angioplasty.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
